t=\"張凌赫完美外型令他收獲不少粉絲。（張凌赫微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250327/982006714276515840820951.jpeg/l3xoDwB3jhBr1qNNkSo9mAnQ1vYTiUcU3BYjV9wWI1c\"/><figcaption>張凌赫完美外型令他收獲不少粉絲。（張凌赫微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"張凌赫五官俊秀。（張凌赫微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250123/959184092060979200417203.jpeg/oeXpIlu54oquA5kUq4zKStJBH0o7X7QpA4ADPwOAAz8\"/><figcaption>張凌赫五官俊秀。（張凌赫微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"張凌赫被網民稱為神顏。（張凌赫微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250123/959183941758095360672315.jpeg/63pkLf2u7KBH0irEIQCEG8vA71r_ZyoH8SG1NvEhtTY\"/><figcaption>張凌赫被網民稱為神顏。（張凌赫微博圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T12:45:52.464884+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2755,"images":32,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T12:30:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:38.179488+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T12:38:45.730727+00:00","content_hash":"8a8cb061f68c5d2e5698c7986ae1a3fcce4ca3f84c873d5966aca66250e33e6a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}